  "description": "Drive the forms of a Gtk.Windows.Forms.Base application from code: show a form, find its controls by name, click, type, select and press keys the way a user would (disabled or hidden controls refuse input), script MessageBox answers, wait for conditions, and capture any control as a Gtk.Drawing Bitmap to compare against committed baseline images. Runs in-process and works with any test framework; Gtk.Windows.Forms.Automation.Xunit adds the single-thread xUnit runner GTK needs.",
